      "start_seconds": 0.63,
      "end_seconds": 5.61,
      "duration_seconds": 4.98,
      "text": "let me think, sorry, doctor, shall I sit here?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 6.12,
      "end_seconds": 10.55,
      "duration_seconds": 4.43,
      "text": "Right, that's fine, sit down. Tell me why you came."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 11.28,
      "end_seconds": 17.63,
      "duration_seconds": 6.35,
      "text": "Okay, so I've been feeling low, and I wanted to get it checked."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 19.0,
      "end_seconds": 22.4,
      "duration_seconds": 3.4,
      "text": "How long has this been bothering you?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 23.38,
      "end_seconds": 27.24,
      "duration_seconds": 3.86,
      "text": "it's been going on for three weeks"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 28.67,
      "end_seconds": 36.71,
      "duration_seconds": 8.04,
      "text": "can you describe it a bit more for me? How strong it is, what the pattern is, what helps"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 40.33,
      "end_seconds": 47.69,
      "duration_seconds": 7.36,
      "text": "I get some relief from talking to a friend. I'd call it severe."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 48.36,
      "end_seconds": 53.13,
      "duration_seconds": 4.77,
      "text": "What about a tight chest when stressed, have you noticed that?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 53.69,
      "end_seconds": 54.74,
      "duration_seconds": 1.05,
      "text": "mm, yes"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 56.75,
      "end_seconds": 59.11,
      "duration_seconds": 2.36,
      "text": "How much does it limit you?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 60.04,
      "end_seconds": 61.17,
      "duration_seconds": 1.13,
      "text": "Mostly mild."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 75.59,
      "end_seconds": 80.0,
      "duration_seconds": 4.41,
      "text": "Let me get the readings out of the way."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 91.49,
      "end_seconds": 94.22,
      "duration_seconds": 2.73,
      "text": "keep your arm relaxed for me.."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 103.47,
      "end_seconds": 110.85,
      "duration_seconds": 7.38,
      "text": "Okay: respiratory rate 18, pressure 115 over 73, temperature is 36.5 degrees. And heart rate 81."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 113.5,
      "end_seconds": 117.35,
      "duration_seconds": 3.85,
      "text": "right, let's have a a proper look at you"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 118.38,
      "end_seconds": 119.08,
      "duration_seconds": 0.7,
      "text": "Right."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 120.24,
      "end_seconds": 121.59,
      "duration_seconds": 1.35,
      "text": "nearly finished here"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 130.98,
      "end_seconds": 136.84,
      "duration_seconds": 5.86,
      "text": "Your pulse and blood pressure are normal and you are tearful when talking about work."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 138.82,
      "end_seconds": 140.35,
      "duration_seconds": 1.53,
      "text": "Yeah, no problem."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 142.39,
      "end_seconds": 145.16,
      "duration_seconds": 2.77,
      "text": "thank you, you can get dressed"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 159.57,
      "end_seconds": 161.91,
      "duration_seconds": 2.34,
      "text": "Nothing like thoughts of harming myself?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 162.65,
      "end_seconds": 165.46,
      "duration_seconds": 2.81,
      "text": "Definitely no thoughts of harming myself."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 166.44,
      "end_seconds": 171.91,
      "duration_seconds": 5.47,
      "text": "have you had any hearing voices, weight loss or chest pain?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 173.36,
      "end_seconds": 178.26,
      "duration_seconds": 4.9,
      "text": "Erm, no, no hearing voices, weight loss or chest pain."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 180.21,
      "end_seconds": 182.58,
      "duration_seconds": 2.37,
      "text": "Is your digestion otherwise okay?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 183.9,
      "end_seconds": 185.67,
      "duration_seconds": 1.77,
      "text": "nothing unusual, no"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 196.73,
      "end_seconds": 200.52,
      "duration_seconds": 3.79,
      "text": "Is there anything relevant on the family side?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 201.92,
      "end_seconds": 204.36,
      "duration_seconds": 2.44,
      "text": "my sister had breast cancer"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 216.47,
      "end_seconds": 221.08,
      "duration_seconds": 4.61,
      "text": "So, any medical conditions, anything you've been treated for?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 223.1,
      "end_seconds": 227.74,
      "duration_seconds": 4.64,
      "text": "Uh, uh, no, I've always been fairly healthy."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 229.01,
      "end_seconds": 232.34,
      "duration_seconds": 3.33,
      "text": "Is there any regular medication you use?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 233.25,
      "end_seconds": 234.41,
      "duration_seconds": 1.16,
      "text": "No, none."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 236.19,
      "end_seconds": 241.5,
      "duration_seconds": 5.31,
      "text": "are you allergic to anything? Any allergies to medicines or foods?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 243.03,
      "end_seconds": 245.86,
      "duration_seconds": 2.83,
      "text": "No, I'm not allergic to anything."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 247.91,
      "end_seconds": 250.69,
      "duration_seconds": 2.78,
      "text": "A few questions about your lifestyle now."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 252.43,
      "end_seconds": 267.8,
      "duration_seconds": 15.37,
      "text": "I smoke roughly a pack every two days. My husband and I live above the shop. Lots of rice, lentils and some fruit. I hardly move around during the day"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 269.06,
      "end_seconds": 279.43,
      "duration_seconds": 10.37,
      "text": "From what you've told me and and what I found, I think we're dealing with low mood linked to work stress at this stage."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 280.36,
      "end_seconds": 284.38,
      "duration_seconds": 4.02,
      "text": "Uh, is there something to worry about?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 285.62,
      "end_seconds": 301.03,
      "duration_seconds": 15.41,
      "text": "Nothing I've seen today points to an emergency. It looks like low mood linked to work stress, but I'd like to confirm. Let's get a thyroid test, for low mood and fatigue."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 302.83,
      "end_seconds": 305.13,
      "duration_seconds": 2.3,
      "text": "do I need to prepare?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 306.73,
      "end_seconds": 331.12,
      "duration_seconds": 24.39,
      "text": "The treatment will be sertraline, 50 milligrams, once a day, for six weeks then review. That's for low mood. Try a short walk each day and keep a regular bedtime. I'm going to send a referral to the talking therapies service. I think we're done unless you have questions."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 332.46,
      "end_seconds": 334.8,
      "duration_seconds": 2.34,
      "text": "alright, thanks, take care"
    }
  ]
